   "cara": "Derrotado",
   "camara": "G"
  },
  {
   "n": 6,
   "inicio": 10.14,
   "fin": 12.38,
   "texto": "So everybody saves the fake stuff for Tuesday.",
   "escenario": "Pueblo de día",
   "en_pantalla": "Gente con libretas y listas esperando frente al calendario",
   "cara": "Ansiosos",
   "camara": "G"
  },
  {
   "n": 7,
   "inicio": 12.38,
   "fin": 14.26,
   "texto": "Birthday presents get opened on Tuesdays,",
   "escenario": "Sala",
   "en_pantalla": "Niño abre un regalo: medias",
   "cara": "Sonrisa forzada",
   "camara": "M"
  },
  {
   "n": 8,
   "inicio": 14.26,
   "fin": 15.38,
   "texto": "so you can say \"I love it.\"",
   "escenario": "Sala",
   "en_pantalla": "Niño abraza las medias; la tía feliz",
   "cara": "Sonrisa forzada, feliz",
   "camara": "C"
  },
  {
   "n": 9,
   "inicio": 15.38,
   "fin": 16.86,
   "texto": "Dentists only work Tuesdays.",
   "escenario": "Calle de día",
   "en_pantalla": "Consultorio con letrero OPEN TUESDAYS ONLY",
   "cara": "(sin personaje)",
   "camara": "M"
  },
  {
   "n": 10,
   "inicio": 16.86,
   "fin": 17.66,
   "texto": "\"This won't hurt a bit.\"",
   "escenario": "Consultorio",
   "en_pantalla": "Dentista con un taladro enorme; paciente",
   "cara": "Dentista sonriente, paciente con pánico",
   "camara": "M"
  },
  {
   "n": 11,
   "inicio": 17.66,
   "fin": 19.38,
   "texto": "The weatherman says it's raining tacos.",
   "escenario": "Sala",
   "en_pantalla": "Televisor: mapa del clima con tacos cayendo",
   "cara": "Presentador serio",
   "camara": "C"
  },
  {
   "n": 12,
   "inicio": 19.38,
   "fin": 20.42,
   "texto": "But there's a catch.",
   "escenario": "Pueblo de día",
   "en_pantalla": "Calendario, martes en rojo",
   "cara": "(sin personaje)",
   "camara": "C"
  },
  {
   "n": 13,
   "inicio": 20.42,
   "fin": 22.54,
   "texto": "Nobody believes one word you say on a Tuesday.",
   "escenario": "Calle de día",
   "en_pantalla": "Niño grita señalando su casa con humo; vecinos se ríen",
   "cara": "Pánico, risas",
   "camara": "G"
  },
  {
   "n": 14,
   "inicio": 22.54,
   "fin": 23.82,
   "texto": "I keep a Tuesday List.",
   "escenario": "Cuarto",
   "en_pantalla": "Libreta con título TUESDAY LIST",
   "cara": "Narrador orgulloso",
   "camara": "M"
  },
  {
   "n": 15,
   "inicio": 23.82,
   "fin": 25.44,
   "texto": "Fourteen lies, ready to go.",
   "escenario": "Cuarto",
   "en_pantalla": "Lista numerada del 1 al 14",
   "cara": "(sin personaje)",
   "camara": "C"
  },
  {
   "n": 16,
   "inicio": 25.44,
   "fin": 26.18,
   "texto": "\"I flossed.\"",
   "escenario": "Baño",
   "en_pantalla": "Narrador frente al espejo; hilo dental sin abrir",
   "cara": "Sonrisa falsa",
   "camara": "C"
  },
  {
   "n": 17,
   "inicio": 26.18,
   "fin": 27.32,
   "texto": "\"Great meatloaf, Dad.\"",
   "escenario": "Cocina",
   "en_pantalla": "Pastel de carne gris y hundido; papá esperanzado",
   "cara": "Sonrisa falsa, papá ilusionado",
   "camara": "M"
  },
  {
   "n": 18,
   "inicio": 27.32,
   "fin": 28.36,
   "texto": "And number fourteen.",
   "escenario": "Cuarto",
   "en_pantalla": "Renglón 14 de la lista, subrayado",
   "cara": "(sin personaje)",
   "camara": "C"
  },
  {
   "n": 19,
   "inicio": 28.36,
   "fin": 29.26,
   "texto": "Tell Tess I like her.",
   "escenario": "Colegio, pasillo",
   "en_pantalla": "Tess en su casillero, moñas con lápices",
   "cara": "Tess feliz",
   "camara": "M"
  },
  {
   "n": 20,
   "inicio": 29.26,
   "fin": 31.86,
   "texto": "If she laughs, say \"Gotcha, it's Tuesday.\"",
   "escenario": "Colegio, pasillo",
   "en_pantalla": "Narrador con pistolitas de dedos",
   "cara": "Sonrisa nerviosa",
   "camara": "C"
  },
  {
   "n": 21,
   "inicio": 31.86,
   "fin": 33.84,
   "texto": "I've done it thirty-one Tuesdays in a row.",
   "escenario": "Cuarto",
   "en_pantalla": "Pared con 31 rayitas",
   "cara": "(sin personaje)",
   "camara": "C"
  },
  {
   "n": 22,
   "inicio": 33.84,
   "fin": 34.62,
   "texto": "She laughs every time.",
   "escenario": "Colegio, pasillo",
   "en_pantalla": "Tess riendo",
   "cara": "Risa",
   "camara": "C"
  },
  {
   "n": 23,
   "inicio": 34.62,
   "fin": 37.2,
   "texto": "Then every Wednesday she falls asleep in first period.",
   "escenario": "Colegio, salón",
   "en_pantalla": "Tess dormida sobre el pupitre; letrero WEDNESDAY",
   "cara": "Dormida",
   "camara": "M"
  },
  {
   "n": 24,
   "inicio": 37.2,
   "fin": 38.22,
   "texto": "Nobody knows why.",
   "escenario": "Colegio, salón",
   "en_pantalla": "Narrador la mira desde su puesto",
   "cara": "Curioso",
   "camara": "C"
  },
  {
   "n": 25,
   "inicio": 38.22,
   "fin": 40.7,
   "texto": "Last Monday, Tess told me her family is moving.",
   "escenario": "Colegio, cafetería",
   "en_pantalla": "Tess con la bandeja, sin sonreír",
   "cara": "Triste",
   "camara": "M"
  },
  {
   "n": 26,
   "inicio": 40.7,
   "fin": 42.16,
   "texto": "Wednesday. Seven a.m.",
